OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifting has become totally
OL,4,Anormalised': The crime blighting
OL,5,Acommunities across England
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 500,000 shoplifting offences
OL,8,Fwere recorded by police forces across
OL,9,FEngland last year ` and just over half
OL,10,Fwere closed without an identified
OL,11,Fsuspect
OL,13,FWhile the number of recorded crimes has
OL,14,Fdropped from a record-breaking high in
OL,15,F2024-25, it is still significantly
OL,16,Fhigher than pre-pandemic levels
OL,18,FWe'll be hearing more about the impact
OL,19,Fof these crimes and how different
OL,20,Fcommunities are responding
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
